                                            <div class="row justify-content-center">
                                                <div class="col-xl-8 col-lg-10" style="width: 100%;">
                                                    <div class="faq__wrap faq__wrap-three">
                                                        <div class="accordion" id="government-relations-pro-services-trade-license-services-accordion">
                                                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                                                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                                                    <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#government-relations-pro-services-trade-license-services-collapseOne" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="government-relations-pro-services-trade-license-services-collapseOne">1. What primary trade licenses are issued in Dubai Mainland?</button>
                                                                </h2>
                                                                <div id="government-relations-pro-services-trade-license-services-collapseOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#government-relations-pro-services-trade-license-services-accordion">
                                                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                                                        <p>The Department of Economy and Tourism (DET) issues commercial licenses for trading physical products, professional licenses for skill-based services, and industrial licenses for manufacturing. Virtuo's corporate team analyzes your business model to select the exact activity codes, ensuring your license accommodates all required operations smoothly without legal complications.</p>
                                                                    </div>
                                                                </div>
                                                            </div>
                                                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                                                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#government-relations-pro-services-trade-license-services-collapseTwo" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="government-relations-pro-services-trade-license-services-collapseTwo">2. Can a foreign investor own a company entirely under a Dubai trade license?</button>
                                                                </h2>
                                                                <div id="government-relations-pro-services-trade-license-services-collapseTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#government-relations-pro-services-trade-license-services-accordion">
                                                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                                                        <p>Yes, modern updates to UAE commercial laws allow international entrepreneurs to maintain absolute foreign ownership and equity over their mainland companies. This eliminates the historical requirement to find a local national shareholder to partner with. Virtuo acts as your registry architect, navigating the regulatory criteria so you can retain full control over your profits.</p>
                                                                    </div>
