                                                <div class="col-xl-8 col-lg-10" style="width: 100%;">
                                                    <div class="faq__wrap faq__wrap-three">
                                                        <div class="accordion" id="government-relations-pro-services-translation-services-accordion">
                                                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                                                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                                                    <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#government-relations-pro-services-translation-services-collapseOne" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="government-relations-pro-services-translation-services-collapseOne">1. What makes a translation &quot;legal&quot; and compliant for use in Dubai?</button>
                                                                </h2>
                                                                <div id="government-relations-pro-services-translation-services-collapseOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#government-relations-pro-services-translation-services-accordion">
                                                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                                                        <p>A translation is only recognized as legally valid in the UAE if it is produced by a professional translator who is officially licensed and registered by the UAE Ministry of Justice. Virtuo's translation team holds active certifications, meaning every document we deliver bears the mandatory registration seal and license number required to prevent automatic rejections across government departments.</p>
                                                                    </div>
                                                                </div>
                                                            </div>
                                                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                                                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#government-relations-pro-services-translation-services-collapseTwo" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="government-relations-pro-services-translation-services-collapseTwo">2. Can I translate my own corporate or personal documents if I am fluent?</button>
                                                                </h2>
                                                                <div id="government-relations-pro-services-translation-services-collapseTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#government-relations-pro-services-translation-services-accordion">
                                                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                                                        <p>No, personal translations or copies generated via automated digital translation tools are completely inadmissible for any official purpose in the UAE. Virtuo acts as your certified linguistic registrar, providing the mandatory independent, court-approved affidavit and signature needed to give your foreign records legitimate standing before local ministries.</p>
                                                                    </div>
                                                                </div>
                                                            </div>
                                                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                                                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#government-relations-pro-services-translation-services-collapseThree" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="government-relations-pro-services-translation-services-collapseThree">3. Do translated documents require further government attestation?</button>
                                                                </h2>
                                                                <div id="government-relations-pro-services-translation-services-collapseThree" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#government-relations-pro-services-translation-services-accordion">
                                                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                                                        <p>Yes, depending on your specific destination checkpoint, a document originally issued outside the country must usually clear foreign ministry and local embassy attestation pipelines before the legal translation can be utilized. Virtuo coordinates your entire documentation flow, seamlessly linking our cross-border attestation services directly into our certified legal translation pipelines.</p>
                                                                    </div>
                                                                </div>
                                                            </div>
                                                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                                                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#government-relations-pro-services-translation-services-collapseFour" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="government-relations-pro-services-translation-services-collapseFour">4. How long does the certified legal translation process typically take?</button>
                                                                </h2>
                                                                <div id="government-relations-pro-services-translation-services-collapseFour" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#government-relations-pro-services-translation-services-accordion">
                                                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                                                        <p>Submitting unverified or poorly formatted drafts can stall your corporate setup pipelines and trigger substantial operational delays. Virtuo protects your project timeline by leveraging our in-house network of licensed specialists to execute standard contracts, vital certificates, and resolutions within rapid, express turnaround windows.</p>
                                                                    </div>
